full-query: "A company has purchased a software license and installed the software in on-premise servers. The servers are being migrated from on premise to AWS EC2 and the license requires that the software should be installed in the same EC2 physical hosts. As a DevOps engineer, you need to deploy the EC2 instances and manage the software license properly. Which combinations of services would you choose to achieve the requirements?"
